    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κόλχος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Colchian</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.2
		</span></i>, etc.:—Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κολχικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		<u>Colchian</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Id.
			2.105
		</span></i>:—poet. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κόλχος</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.485
				</span></i>
			:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κολχίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.2
			</span></i> (but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηδείᾳ τῇ Κόλχῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					285c
				</span></i>
			): as Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κολχίς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), <u>Colchis</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.104
			</span></i>, etc.; (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				132
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
